# Page-Header Ribbon Background Images

## **Overview**
Page-header / ribbon images are **full-bleed background plates only**. HTML overlays the title, breadcrumbs, and short description on the **LEFT**. The image must never contain text, wordmarks, UI chrome, or faces (unless the user explicitly requests faces).

Use this rule whenever the user asks to create, restyle, export, or optimize a **header ribbon**, **page header background**, or **inner-page banner strip**.

## **Input Parameters (user fills these)**

Ask for or extract these before generating. Leave unused fields blank.

| Parameter | What to fill | Example (KCNJ) |
|-----------|--------------|----------------|
| `{{THEME}}` | Motif on the **right** 25–30% | Kerala / New Jersey community / Statue of Liberty |
| `{{LOGO_OR_STYLE_REF}}` | Path or attached image used as **style** only (no wordmark in the ribbon) | [logo_latest.jpeg](mdc:public/images/kcnj/new_logo/logo_latest.jpeg) |
| `{{DESIGN_SYSTEM_REF}}` | Homepage screenshot or palette | Cream `#F2E7D5` / `#F3E8D6`, forest-green headings, terracotta accents |
| `{{FIELD_COLOR}}` | Calm left-side field (hex) | `#F2E7D5` |
| `{{DEST_DIR}}` | Output folder | `public/images/kcnj/page_header/` |
| `{{ASSET_SLUG}}` | File basename | `header_ribbon` |
| `{{FACES}}` | `no` (default) or `yes` | `no` |

## **Copyable Generation Prompt**

Fill the `{{...}}` fields, then send as-is to the image model (or to the agent). Do not add extra UI, frames, or letterboxing.

```text
Create a full-bleed website page-header / ribbon background image.

THEME / MOTIF (RIGHT SIDE ONLY)
- {{THEME}}
- Style reference (visual language only, do not place a logo or wordmark in the image): {{LOGO_OR_STYLE_REF}}
- Match this design-system field color and mood: {{DESIGN_SYSTEM_REF}}
- Left-side field color: {{FIELD_COLOR}}
- Faces: {{FACES}}

PURPOSE
- Background plate only for a site header ribbon.
- HTML will overlay title, breadcrumbs, and short description on the LEFT.
- Do NOT render any text, letters, numbers, logos-with-words, UI chrome, buttons, cards, or mock device frames.

LAYOUT (fixed)
- Ultra-wide horizontal banner strip.
- LEFT ~70–75% width: calm negative space / soft field for text overlay (keep this side quieter and less detailed).
- RIGHT ~25–30% width: optional visual interest (abstract motif, brand-friendly ornament, soft emblem shape, or atmospheric detail) that fades toward the left.
- Keep critical visual detail out of the left text-safe zone.
- Keep top/bottom edges relatively clean (thin header rules may sit there).

DIMENSIONS / RESPONSIVENESS
Provide (or design for) these exports:
1) Desktop / primary: 3360 × 800 px (21:5), 2x retina-ready
2) Desktop fallback: 2100 × 500 px (21:5)
3) Tablet: 1600 × 560 px (~20:7)
4) Mobile: 1200 × 720 px (5:3) — same composition logic, slightly taller crop is OK if needed for readability, but keep left text-safe area and right visual zone

COMPOSITION RULES FOR ALL SIZES
- Subject/weight stays on the RIGHT.
- LEFT remains open for overlay text.
- Soft vignette or gentle left-to-right depth is allowed.
- Edge-to-edge (no mock device frame, no letterboxing inside the canvas).

OUTPUT
- Clean wide banner background, high resolution, web-ready.
- No people faces unless Faces is yes.
- No readable text of any kind.
```

## **Responsive Export Sizes**

| Use | Filename token | Size (px) | Ratio | Role |
|-----|----------------|-----------|-------|------|
| Desktop 2x retina | `desktop_retina` | **3360 × 800** | 21:5 | Primary `srcset` / high-DPI |
| Desktop fallback | `desktop_fallback` | **2100 × 500** | 21:5 | 1x / CSS `cover` fallback |
| Tablet | `tablet` | **1600 × 560** | ~20:7 | Mid-width viewports |
| Mobile | `mobile` | **1200 × 720** | 5:3 | Taller crop OK; keep left safe zone |

Generate (or composite) at the **widest** size first, then crop/resize down. Do **not** invent a new composition per breakpoint — only change crop height.

## **Optimization**

- **Web delivery: JPEG** (quality ~82–88). Ribbons have no transparency; JPEG is much smaller than PNG on mobile.
- **Masters: PNG** (lossless) in the parent folder only. Do not ship PNG as the live CSS background.
- **sRGB**, no ICC surprises. Flatten to `{{FIELD_COLOR}}` (no checkerboard, no alpha).
- Prefer one web folder of four JPGs over a pile of duplicate PNG+JPG pairs.

### **Folder layout**

```
{{DEST_DIR}}
  {{ASSET_SLUG}}_source_*.png|jpg     # optional generation master
  {{ASSET_SLUG}}_{WxH}.png            # lossless size masters (optional)
  header_ribbon/                      # web-optimized JPGs only
    {{ASSET_SLUG}}_desktop_retina_3360x800.jpg
    {{ASSET_SLUG}}_desktop_fallback_2100x500.jpg
    {{ASSET_SLUG}}_tablet_1600x560.jpg
    {{ASSET_SLUG}}_mobile_1200x720.jpg
```

Naming: `{{ASSET_SLUG}}_{use}_{WxH}.jpg`

## **CSS / HTML usage**

HTML owns the title on the left. CSS should **cover** the strip and pin the motif to the right so `cover` cropping eats the right, not the text-safe left.

```css
.page-header-ribbon {
  background-image: url("/images/.../header_ribbon_desktop_fallback_2100x500.jpg");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: right center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}
```

```html
<picture>
  <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="/images/.../header_ribbon_mobile_1200x720.jpg" />
  <source media="(max-width: 1023px)" srcset="/images/.../header_ribbon_tablet_1600x560.jpg" />
  <source media="(min-width: 1600px)" srcset="/images/.../header_ribbon_desktop_retina_3360x800.jpg" />
  <img src="/images/.../header_ribbon_desktop_fallback_2100x500.jpg" alt="" />
</picture>
```

Decorative ribbon: empty `alt`. Real heading stays in HTML.

## **DO / DON'T**

### **DO**
- Keep left **70–75%** quiet and matching `{{FIELD_COLOR}}`.
- Fade the right motif into the field (no hard vertical seam).
- Export all four sizes from one composition.
- Use JPEG for web; PNG only as masters.
- Treat logos as **style references**, not as pasted badges.

### **DON'T**
- Put title, breadcrumbs, org name, or any letters in the bitmap.
- Center the motif (HTML text would sit on top of it).
- Use `object-contain` / letterboxing for this strip (use `cover` + `right center`).
- Ship uncompressed PNG as the live header background.
- Crop into the left text-safe zone when making the mobile 5:3 variant.

## **Worked example (KCNJ)**

- Theme: Kerala houseboat / palms, Kerala + NJ maps, Statue of Liberty — **no wordmark**.
- Field: `#F2E7D5` / `#F3E8D6`.
- Style ref: [logo_latest.jpeg](mdc:public/images/kcnj/new_logo/logo_latest.jpeg)
- Web JPGs: `public/images/kcnj/page_header/header_ribbon/`

Related: [image_containment_prevention_hero_images_cards.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/image_containment_prevention_hero_images_cards.mdc) is for hero/cards (`object-contain`). Header ribbons use **`cover` + `right center`** instead.
